-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
NOTE ON BUNDLED SOFTWARE
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Aegis OS is a distribution: it aggregates a large amount of third-party software
(the Linux kernel, Arch Linux packages, BlackArch tools, XFCE, Calamares, and the
bundled AI agents Claude Code, OpenCode, Aider, and Codex). Each of those retains
its own upstream license and copyright. This GPL-3.0 license applies ONLY to the
original build scripts, packaging, configuration, and branding authored within
this repository. Consult each upstream project for its own terms — in particular,
the bundled AI agents are subject to the terms of their respective vendors.
